A||||20||Sanfran||2.8 (How much horsepower can u get out of it)||||1||
Z||000000||Sanfran||06-03-2001||10:10 PM||||My mechanic friend said that he can get up to 200 hp out of my 2.8 with boring out the engine, new cams, etc. Is this true and mods. would have to be done.  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1626330&a=12427866&p=45623747"> <BR>'86 2m4 <BR>Modified w/V6||||reg||1
